<title>SINGAPORE: Metalock half-year net surges 81 percent.</title>
<headline>Metalock half-year net surges 81 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	  (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.04  vs    0.58</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    4.34  vs    2.41</p>
<p>    Turnover				16.28  vs   15.88</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.37  vs    0.37</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.08  vs    0.09</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     1.30  vs    1.90</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1.57  vs    0.94</p>
<p>    Tax					0.45  vs    0.36</p>
<p>Note - Metalock (Singapore) Ltd is engaged in marine engineering, sales of oil rig tools and marketing of marine equipment. -- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
